# {{projectName}}

Apache Airflow deployment scaffolded with [dude](https://github.com/cubocicloide/dude)
(`airflow` stack). Airflow 3 in Docker Compose{{#if withIac}} + Terraform for
AWS ECS Fargate (ECS executor — every task in its own container){{/if}};
sign-on via {{#if withEntraId}}Microsoft Entra ID{{else}}the native Airflow
user database{{/if}}.

## Quickstart

```bash
export GITHUB_TOKEN=<your-pat>
npm install -g @cubocicloide/dude-launcher   # once per machine
pnpm install                                 # provision the pinned toolchain
{{#if withEntraId}}
# fill AZURE_TENANT_ID / AZURE_CLIENT_ID / AZURE_CLIENT_SECRET in .env first
{{/if}}
dude up --build
open http://localhost:8080                   {{#unless withEntraId}}# admin / admin{{/unless}}
```

## Layout

```
airflow/
├── Dockerfile           # apache/airflow + requirements.txt
├── requirements.txt     # extra Python packages (pinned)
├── config/webserver_config.py   # sign-on (FAB auth manager)
├── dags/
│   ├── lib/             # shared helpers (defaults, callbacks) — no DAGs
│   └── examples/        # example_etl, example_ecs_task,
│                        # example_kubernetes_pod, example_batch_compute
├── plugins/ops_toolkit/ # listeners + macros + WorkdayTimetable
└── tests/               # DAG integrity suite (dude test)
{{#if withIac}}
iac/                     # Terraform — AWS ECS Fargate (dude iac …)
{{/if}}
docs/                    # MkDocs site (dude docs)
```

## Commands

`dude help` shows the live catalog. Highlights: `dude up|down|logs|shell`,
`dude dag list|errors|trigger|test`, `dude lint`, `dude test`, `dude format`,
`dude docs`{{#if withIac}}, `dude iac …` (bootstrap → apply → migrate → ship){{/if}}.

Full documentation: `dude docs` → http://localhost:8001.
